Summary of modifications made for StreamHub (Apache-2.0, section 4(b)):
  - Renamed the application, Gradle root project and Android package/applicationId to
    com.streamhub.app; renamed StreamFlixApp to StreamHubApp and the native key library
    (JNI symbols and library name) accordingly.
  - Disabled the in-app updater (it pointed at the upstream release feed).
  - Removed the upstream Telegram link; repointed the Help and Supabase-guide links.
  - Removed the upstream git.gay release workflow; added a GitHub Actions debug build.
  - Extracted extractor URL dispatch into Extractor.findExtractor (behaviour unchanged) and made
    the extractor registry lazy.
  - Added the VidplayTopExtractor integration point and unit tests for extractor dispatch.
